            "review_title": "Review at Ngân Đình Hanoi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "pieata\nWellington, New Zealand393 contributions\n0\nA classy place..\nNov 2023 • Friends\nYum Cha buffet lunch…in a fairly new 5 star hotel !\nImpressive classy hotel foyer… restaurant has white table clothed tables..\nImpressive comfy chairs..and expected classy fit out!\nIt was a “ table buffet”..where U order a Yum Cha dish ,and it is brought to the table..next dish ordered, and the process continues. Order n eat!!\nThen, I turned over the menu, to discover Cantonese Roast Duck, and a couple of “ side dishes”.\n We were almost finished when discovering the back page .. so ordered a Roast Duck dish…!!!\nAt first sight, it would have to be the best looking 1/4 Roast Duck, that I have\nseen to date.( and Cantonese Roast Duck, is my favourite dish !!!\nLooked absolutely “ perfect colour wise”..but lacked the flavour marinade , \nthat is the epitome of Cantonese Roast Duck!\nRate 4/10\nThe Yum Cha menu, is Very good, basic.(cf HK) no offal or deep fried taro , or savoury dumplings, etc, etc.. but what was available was 7.5/10.\nThe service was a let down.. 3 staff for 5 tables ( 4..5.. and 3x2 diners)\nThey were too occupied doing nothing, and had to virtually shout, to get their attention.. my arm was sore staying up! 3/10..a disgrace !!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 3, 2023",
